      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "When sorting friends by world and  trying to join a group there were a couple ways I found of doing that.\nYou could select the world at the top, and then hit join to go to it. Somehow this counts as joining the world and not as joining as a friend so soft cap is used.\nAlternatively, you could select any friend and join off of them. This counts as joining a friend and I was able to join a world above the soft cap using this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
